    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9371" root="حنو and حنى" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِنَايَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A state of bending,</i> or <i>curving.</i> (K.)
Hence the saying, respecting a man in whose
back is a bending, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنَّ فِيهِ لِحِنَايَةٌ يَهُودِيَّةٌ</span> [<i>Verily
in him is a Jewish bending.</i>] (TA.)

